<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:54,940 --> 00:01:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:38,110 --> 00:01:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke here at Point B!</font>

32
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura here at Point C!</font>

33
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto here. I'm at Point A!</font>

34
00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're slow, Naruto!</font>

35
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, the seventh team...</font>

36
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?!</font>

37
00:01:53,630 --> 00:01:54,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The target has moved!</font>

38
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Follow it!</font>

39
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alright! It's over there!</font>

40
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your distance
from the target?</font>

41
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five meters!
I can go at anytime!</font>

42
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm ready, too!</font>

43
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too...!</font>

44
00:02:19,450 --> 00:02:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

45
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it!</font>

46
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uryaaah!</font>

47
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got him!</font>

48
00:02:29,370 --> 00:02:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does he have the ribbon
on his right ear...?</font>

49
00:02:31,130 --> 00:02:32,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you sure it's our target Tora?</font>

50
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:35,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the target, no mistake.</font>

51
00:02:36,710 --> 00:02:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alright, the mission to capture
lost pet "Tora" is complete!</font>

52
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there a mission
with a greater sense of urgency?!</font>

53
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Impor-</font>

54
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">tant</font>

55
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Mission!</font>

56
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Heading to the
Land of the Waves!</font>

57
00:02:54,690 --> 00:03:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! My cute Tora-chan!
I was worried to death!</font>

58
00:03:01,070 --> 00:03:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Wife of the Land of 
Fire's Feudal Lord</font>

59
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Madame Shijimi and Tora (the Cat)</font>

60
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Serves him right, that stupid cat!</font>

61
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:14,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder he ran away...</font>

62
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...Now, then!</font>

63
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next mission for
Kakashi's seventh team is...</font>

64
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An errand to the neighboring town...
to babysit the Chief Councilor's boy...</font>

65
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Helping with digging
for potatoes, eh...</font>

66
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:32,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

67
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! No, thank you!</font>

68
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me,</font>

69
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to do like
a more exciting mission!</font>

70
00:03:38,530 --> 00:03:39,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give us something else!</font>

71
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's got a point...</font>

72
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man... He's a pain!</font>

73
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it was about time
for him to get fretful...</font>

74
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool!
You're still bottom rookie!</font>

75
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the start,</font>

76
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">everyone moves up
the ladder</font>

77
00:03:56,250 --> 00:03:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by gaining experience
from simple missions!</font>

78
00:03:58,130 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But!</font>

79
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been nothing
but blah missions so far!</font>

80
00:04:04,050 --> 00:04:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off!</font>

81
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

82
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's necessary to explain to you
what a mission is...</font>

83
00:04:14,650 --> 00:04:15,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen to me!</font>

84
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Requests pour into the village
every day.</font>

85
00:04:20,610 --> 00:04:23,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They range from babysitting
to assassinations...</font>

86
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wide spectrum of requests are
recorded on the request list...</font>

87
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:34,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are separated into A, B, C,
and D ranks in order of difficulty.</font>

88
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the village,
everyone below me</font>

89
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is divided up by ability in the order of
Jonin, Chunin, and Genin.</font>

90
00:04:44,970 --> 00:04:48,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We at the highest level distribute
the requests as missions</font>

91
00:04:48,390 --> 00:04:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to Ninja who have abilities
that suit said mission.</font>

92
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, if the mission is successful,
the fee comes in from the client.</font>

93
00:05:00,110 --> 00:05:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nevertheless, you guys
have just become Genin...</font>

94
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rank D is about
the best you can do...</font>

95
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?!</font>

96
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:12,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yesterday's lunch was pork-bone
broth noodles,</font>

97
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so today will be miso broth...</font>

98
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen!</font>

99
00:05:15,330 --> 00:05:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry.</font>

100
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:21,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man!
You always lecture me, old man!</font>

101
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:27,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm not that little prankster
that you think I am!</font>

102
00:05:28,550 --> 00:05:29,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

103
00:05:33,770 --> 00:05:35,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I'm going to get scolded later...</font>

104
00:05:43,530 --> 00:05:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid who could only
express himself with pranks...</font>

105
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, fine!</font>

106
00:05:51,330 --> 00:05:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?!</font>

107
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you insist...</font>

108
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you do a Rank C mission...</font>

109
00:05:58,500 --> 00:06:00,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be bodyguards for someone.</font>

110
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?!</font>

111
00:06:02,550 --> 00:06:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah-ha!</font>

112
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who? Who?</font>

113
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A feudal lord?!</font>

114
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:07,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or, a princess?!</font>

115
00:06:08,050 --> 00:06:09,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get so hasty.</font>

116
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll introduce you now!</font>

117
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:15,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could you please come in...?</font>

118
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?!</font>

119
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:29,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this? It's just a bunch
of damned squirts!</font>

120
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:34,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

121
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Particularly you, the smallest one
with the idiot face.</font>

122
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you really a Ninja?</font>

123
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's the smallest one with
the idiot face he's talking about...?</font>

124
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

125
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill him!!</font>

126
00:06:56,470 --> 00:06:57,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What good will it do to
kill the old man</font>

127
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're supposed to be
guarding, you moron?!</font>

128
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Tazuna,
veteran bridge builder.</font>

129
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be risking life and limb
in guarding me to the max</font>

130
00:07:13,490 --> 00:07:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until I return to my land and
complete my bridge!</font>

131
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

132
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're off!!</font>

133
00:07:38,140 --> 00:07:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you so excited about?!</font>

134
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You see, I've never left
the village before!</font>

135
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Am I really okay with this squirt?!</font>

136
00:07:51,490 --> 00:07:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a Jonin. I'll be watching him.
There's no need to worry.</font>

137
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...okay with this squirt?!</font>

138
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone but this old dude, man...</font>

139
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's really the worst client!</font>

140
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell him a thing or two...</font>

141
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, old man!</font>

142
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be mocking Ninja
so much!</font>

143
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:10,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm awesome, you see!</font>

144
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:14,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a super-elite Ninja who
will be called Hokage one day!</font>

145
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:17,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name's Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

146
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember it well!!</font>

147
00:08:24,350 --> 00:08:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage's the super top-dog
Ninja in the village, right?</font>

148
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:32,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure as hell don't seem like
you could become the Hokage...</font>

149
00:08:32,950 --> 00:08:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ahh! Shut up!</font>

150
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm prepared to do whatever
it takes to become the Hokage!</font>

151
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:43,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll have no choice
but to acknowledge me then!!</font>

152
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:47,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never acknowledge you, squirt...</font>

153
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you become the Hokage!</font>

154
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! I'll kill you!</font>

155
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you to stop it, you moron!</font>

156
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! At least let me have
one shot, just one...</font>

157
00:09:05,770 --> 00:09:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say... Tazuna-san...?</font>

158
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

159
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:12,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your country is
"The Land of the Waves," right?</font>

160
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:15,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What of it?</font>

161
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Kakashi-sensei...</font>

162
00:09:17,570 --> 00:09:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are there Ninja in that land, too?</font>

163
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, there aren't Ninja in
the Land of the Waves...</font>

164
00:09:23,330 --> 00:09:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in other nations, while cultures
and customs are different,</font>

165
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">hidden villages exist,
and there are Ninja there.</font>

166
00:09:35,090 --> 00:09:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To the many nations on the continent,</font>

167
00:09:38,090 --> 00:09:41,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the existence of Shinobi Villages is
a measure of the nation's military strength.</font>

168
00:09:42,970 --> 00:09:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

169
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that is how these nations maintain
their relationships with neighboring nations.</font>

170
00:09:49,230 --> 00:09:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, the villages are not
under the control of the nations.</font>

171
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:56,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are equal in rank.</font>

172
00:09:57,700 --> 00:10:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On a small island like
the Land of the Waves,</font>

173
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where it is difficult to be
influenced by other nations,</font>

174
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:04,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is no need
for a Shinobi village.</font>

175
00:10:08,370 --> 00:10:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Among the respective nations
that possess a Shinobi Village,</font>

176
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the five nations of "Fire," "Water,"
"Lightning," "Wind," and "Earth,"</font>

177
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">due to their large territory and
immeasurable power,</font>

178
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are called the "Five Great Nations."</font>

179
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves
of the Land of Fire,</font>

180
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Village Hidden in the Mist
of the Land of Water,</font>

181
00:10:31,310 --> 00:10:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Village Hidden in the Clouds
of the Land of Lightning,</font>

182
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Village Hidden in the Sand
of the Land of Wind,</font>

183
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Village Hidden in the Rocks
of the Land of Earth.</font>

184
00:10:40,450 --> 00:10:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the leaders of
each of these Hidden Villages</font>

185
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are allowed to have
the name of Kage, the Shadow.</font>

186
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The "Hokage"
(Fire shadow),</font>

187
00:10:48,370 --> 00:10:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Mizukage"
(Water Shadow),</font>

188
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Raikage"
(Lightning Shadow),</font>

189
00:10:50,830 --> 00:10:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Kazekage"
(Wind Shadow),</font>

190
00:10:52,130 --> 00:10:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Tsuchikage"
(Earth Shadow),</font>

191
00:10:53,250 --> 00:10:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the so-called
Five Kage (shadows),</font>

192
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">reign supreme over
the tens of thousands of Ninja</font>

193
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in each nation
of the whole world.</font>

194
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding...
Hokage-sama is that incredible!</font>

195
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that blah old man
is really that incredible...</font>

196
00:11:08,390 --> 00:11:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sounds fishy!</font>

197
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That can't be true! No way!</font>

198
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

199
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys just doubted
Hokage-sama now, didn't you...?</font>

200
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... don't worry.</font>

201
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no Ninja battles
in Rank C missions.</font>

202
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:39,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, there's no worry of getting
into a scrape with foreign Ninja...!</font>

203
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, not.</font>

204
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Huh?!</font>

205
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?</font>

206
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:37,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first one!</font>

207
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">K-Kakashi-sensei!</font>

208
00:12:53,710 --> 00:12:55,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second one...</font>

209
00:12:58,250 --> 00:12:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second one...</font>

210
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...!</font>

211
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?!</font>

212
00:13:21,730 --> 00:13:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't come off!</font>

213
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W... Wow!!</font>

214
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa!</font>

215
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ugh!!</font>

216
00:13:41,340 --> 00:13:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'll come!</font>

217
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to do it...
I have to!!</font>

218
00:13:45,260 --> 00:13:46,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get back, sir!!</font>

219
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo...</font>

220
00:14:14,290 --> 00:14:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei...! He's alive!</font>

221
00:14:17,460 --> 00:14:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!
Show off...</font>

222
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

223
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what was that...?</font>

224
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Kakashi-sensei... used Substitutions...</font>

225
00:14:32,970 --> 00:14:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...
Sorry I didn't help you right away...</font>

226
00:14:37,770 --> 00:14:38,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got you hurt.</font>

227
00:14:40,690 --> 00:14:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think you'd be
incapable of moving...</font>

228
00:14:46,530 --> 00:14:48,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was saved, somehow...</font>

229
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyhow, let me just say,
good job, Sasuke.</font>

230
00:14:55,050 --> 00:14:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, too, Sakura.</font>

231
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:01,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... couldn't do anything...</font>

232
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:04,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but Sasuke...</font>

233
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was his first real battle...</font>

234
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:09,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't he feel scared, at all?</font>

235
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:14,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He saved me like it was nothing and
without getting any dirt on his clothes...</font>

236
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:17,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

237
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

238
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you hurt...</font>

239
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">scaredy cat...?</font>

240
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sasuke!
— Naruto!</font>

241
00:15:30,530 --> 00:15:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys have poison
on their claws.</font>

242
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to
take out the poison quickly.</font>

243
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

244
00:15:38,330 --> 00:15:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to open the wound and
drain the poisoned blood.</font>

245
00:15:41,830 --> 00:15:42,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move so much.</font>

246
00:15:43,210 --> 00:15:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The poison will spread.</font>

247
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, Tazuna-san...</font>

248
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is it...?!</font>

249
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have something
to talk to you about.</font>

250
00:15:55,930 --> 00:15:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin from the
Village Hidden in the Mist...</font>

251
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys are Shinobi known for
continuing to fight</font>

252
00:16:01,730 --> 00:16:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what the sacrifice.</font>

253
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How were you able
to detect our movements?</font>

254
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:11,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There probably wouldn't be
puddles of water</font>

255
00:16:11,570 --> 00:16:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on a clear day like today,
when it hasn't rained for days.</font>

256
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knowing that, why'd you leave it
to the kids to fight?</font>

257
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I felt like it,
I could kill these guys instantly...</font>

258
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...
I had to know...</font>

259
00:16:31,590 --> 00:16:34,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who the target
of these enemies was...</font>

260
00:16:35,430 --> 00:16:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?! What do you mean?</font>

261
00:16:38,890 --> 00:16:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

262
00:16:39,930 --> 00:16:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what I mean is I had to know
if it was you,</font>

263
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:48,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or one of us Shinobi...
who was being targeted.</font>

264
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We haven't heard anything about
you being targeted by Shinobi.</font>

265
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:58,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The content of the request was
supposed to just be</font>

266
00:16:58,830 --> 00:17:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">protection from gangs,
thieves, and the like...</font>

267
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a mission with
a B rank or higher.</font>

268
00:17:07,250 --> 00:17:08,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The request was supposed to be</font>

269
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:11,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for backup protection
until you finished building your bridge...</font>

270
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If our enemies were to be Ninja,</font>

271
00:17:15,470 --> 00:17:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the mission would've been
estimated without question</font>

272
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as an expensive
"B Rank" mission.</font>

273
00:17:21,010 --> 00:17:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears there's some kind
of good reason for this,</font>

274
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:26,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but being lied to in the request
won't do.</font>

275
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:30,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is beyond the scope
of our mission.</font>

276
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mission is too soon for us...</font>

277
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's give it up!</font>

278
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need an anesthetic to
open Naruto's wound</font>

279
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:41,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and get out the poisoned blood...</font>

280
00:17:42,290 --> 00:17:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to return to the village
and take him to a doctor...</font>

281
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:46,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmmm...</font>

282
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm? What...?!</font>

283
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This sure is a burden!</font>

284
00:17:55,220 --> 00:17:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since we need to treat Naruto's wound,
shall we go back to the village...?</font>

285
00:18:07,390 --> 00:18:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh!
— Oh!</font>

286
00:18:16,490 --> 00:18:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why am I so different?!</font>

287
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:22,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's it always me...
Damn it!</font>

288
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! What're you doing?!</font>

289
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should be getting stronger...</font>

290
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I'm steadily carrying
out missions and</font>

291
00:18:32,540 --> 00:18:35,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">doing special-skill training
by myself every day...</font>

292
00:18:39,050 --> 00:18:43,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never get into another situation
from which I'll have to be rescued.</font>

293
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never be afraid
or a be a coward...</font>

294
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:51,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to Sasuke...</font>

295
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:56,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to swear on
the pain of my left hand!</font>

296
00:18:58,990 --> 00:19:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect you, old man...
with this Kunai knife!!</font>

297
00:19:09,290 --> 00:19:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission continues!!</font>

298
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

299
00:19:13,090 --> 00:19:15,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all well and good to
rid yourself of the poisoned blood,</font>

300
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but any more than that and
you'll bleed to death.</font>

301
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:30,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things will get hairy if you don't
stop the bleeding quick... Seriously!</font>

302
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

303
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Argh! No! No!</font>

304
00:19:34,770 --> 00:19:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't die like this!</font>

305
