00:20:01,930 --> 00:20:03,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... um...</font>

313
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I okay?
You look awfully serious...</font>

314
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... You should be okay.</font>

