00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it... the power of
the Nine-Tailed Fox...?</font>

316
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say you failed?!</font>

317
00:20:28,290 --> 00:20:31,460
