319
00:20:35,330 --> 00:20:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop your damned grumbling...!!</font>

320
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time, I'll kill him with this...
